                  <SHORT-NAME>McuFccuEnable</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">&lt;html&gt;
                                This config whether the current module FCCU is enabled or not.&lt;p/&gt;
                                Note: Implementation Specific Parameter.
                            &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
