                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">&lt;html&gt;
                                        Core Reset Enable.&lt;p/&gt;
                                        0 - Main core_2 is not reset.&lt;p/&gt;
                                        1 - Main core_2 is reset.&lt;p/&gt;
                                        Note: Implementation Specific Parameter.
                                    &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
