                                            Enable the Aux Clock for SD_CLK.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            If it is set to 0 (Divider 1 is disabled), any write access to the CGM_AC0_DC1[DIV] field is ignored and the SD_CLK clock remains disabled.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            Note: Implementation Specific Parameter.
                                        &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
                              </DESC>
