                              <SHORT-NAME>McuAuxClk0Div1_Divisor</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">&lt;html&gt;
                                            Set Aux0 Divider 1 Division value.
                                            Set the CGM_AC0_DC1[DIV] field register with value (McuAuxClk0Div1_Divisor - 1).&lt;p/&gt;
                                            The resultant motor control clock will have a period (CGM_AC0_DC1[DIV] + 1) times that of auxiliary clock 1.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            This parameter is enabled only if McuAuxClk0Div1_En is true.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            Note: Implementation Specific Parameter.
