                                        Select the Auxiliary Clock 1 Source Selection.&lt;p/&gt;
                                        Configure the CGM_AC1_SC[SELCTL] field register.&lt;p/&gt;
                                        Note: Implementation Specific Parameter.
                                    &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
                          </DESC>
