                                              <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">&lt;html&gt;
                                                            CGM_AC5_CDC12[DE] field register.&lt;p/&gt;
                                                            Enable the Aux Clock for PSI5_S_DDSR2_CLK.&lt;p/&gt;
                                                            0 - Disable auxiliary clock 5 cascaded divider 12.&lt;p/&gt;
                                                            1 - Enable auxiliary clock 5 cascaded divider 12.&lt;p/&gt;
