                                              <SHORT-NAME>McuAuxClk5CasDiv12_Divisor</SHORT-NAME>
                                              <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="EN">&lt;html&gt;
                                                            Set Auxiliary Clock 5 Cascaded Divider 12 Division value.&lt;p/&gt;
                                                            The resultant peripheral clock will have a period &apos;(DIV + 1) x (CGM_AC5_CDC1[DIV] + 1) x (CGM_AC5_DC2[DIV] + 1)&apos; times that of auxiliary clock 5. &lt;p/&gt;
                                                            If DE is set to 0 (divider is disabled), any write access to the DIV field is ignored and the peripheral clock remains disabled.&lt;p/&gt;
                                                            Note: Implementation Specific Parameter.
                                                        &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
                                              </DESC>
                                              <ORIGIN>Ccfc</ORIGIN>
