                              <SHORT-NAME>McuAuxClk9Div0_Divisor</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">&lt;html&gt;
                                            CGM_AC9_DC0[DIV] field register with value (McuAuxClk9Div0_Divisor - 1).&lt;p/&gt;
                                            The resultant RTI clock will have a period (CGM_AC9_DC0[DIV] + 1) times that of auxiliary clock 9.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            This parameter is enabled only if McuAuxClk9Div0_En is true.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            Note: Implementation Specific Parameter.
                                        &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
