                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">&lt;html&gt;
                                            CGM_AC12_DC1[DE] field register.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            Enable the Aux Clock for I2S0.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            If it is set to 0 (Divider 12 is disabled), any write access to the CGM_AC12_DC1[DIV] field is ignored and the I2S0 clock remains disabled.&lt;p/&gt;
