                              <SHORT-NAME>McuAuxClk12Div1_Divisor</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">&lt;html&gt;
                                            Set Aux12 Divider 1 Division value.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            Set the CGM_AC12_DC1[DIV] field register with value (McuAuxClk12Div1_Divisor - 1).&lt;p/&gt;
                                            The resultant motor control clock will have a period (CGM_AC12_DC1[DIV] + 1) times that of auxiliary clock 0.&lt;p/&gt;
