                                            CGM_AC12_DC1[DE] field register.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            Enable the Aux Clock for I2S1.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            If it is set to 0 (Divider 12 is disabled), any write access to the CGM_AC12_DC2[DIV] field is ignored and the I2S1 clock remains disabled.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            Note: Implementation Specific Parameter.
                                        &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ORIGIN>Ccfc</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
