                                        Short Sequence for HSM functional reset.&lt;p/&gt;
                                        0 - Not possible to set.&lt;p/&gt;
                                        1 - The reset sequence triggered by a HSM functional reset event will start from PHASE3, skipping PHASE1 and PHASE2.&lt;p/&gt;
                                        Note: Implementation Specific Parameter.
                                    &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
                          </DESC>
