                                        Bidirectional Reset Enable for HSM functional reset request.&lt;p/&gt;
                                        0 - ESR0 is asserted on a HSM functional reset request event.&lt;p/&gt;
                                        1 - ESR0 is not asserted on a HSM functional reset request event.&lt;p/&gt;
