                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">&lt;html&gt;
                                            REE_VD9[HVD9_IO_5V] field register value.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            This bit defines whether an HVD assertion on the supply of the IO_5V generates a system reset.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            0 - Disabled. HVD assertion on the supply of the IO_5V does not cause system reset.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            1 - Enabled. HVD assertion on the supply of the IO_5V causes system reset.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            Note: Implementation Specific Parameter.
                                        &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
                              </DESC>
