                                            This bit defines whether an LVD assertion on the supply of the IO_5V generates a a POR reset.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            0 - Disabled. LVD assertion on the supply of the IO_5V does not cause a POR reset.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            1 - Enabled. LVD assertion on the supply of the IO_5V causes a POR reset.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            Note: Implementation Specific Parameter.
                                        &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ORIGIN>Ccfc</ORIGIN>
