                                            REE_VD9[HVD9_PMC] field register value.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            This bit defines whether an HVD assertion on the supply of the PMC generates system reset.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            0 - Disabled. HVD assertion on the supply of the PMC does not cause system reset.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            1 - Enabled. HVD assertion on the supply of the PMC causes system reset.&lt;p/&gt;
                                            Note: Implementation Specific Parameter.
                                        &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
