                      <SHORT-NAME>McuPMC_FCCUEventEnConfig</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">&lt;html&gt;
                                    This FCCU Event Enable Register controls whether the voltage detect signal event causes an event signal
                                    to be sent to the FCCU (Fault Collection and Control Unit).&lt;p/&gt;
                                    Note: Implementation Specific Parameter.
                                &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
